[A.]
<h2>Defence</h2>
<p><i><br>~I~l"But if Nimbus were round everything would fall off"~.</i> 
</br><i>~I"Everthing ~Bdoes~N~I fall off."~.</i>
<br><i>~I~l"Oh"~.</i></br>
<br><i>~x---physicist arguing with the high council of nimbus.~.
</i></br>
<br>The Lord of <?{vn_windall}>Wind~.</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain~.</?> has  noticed that speedy attacking is quite clearly not your forte, and so tasks you with a more defensive role.
<?!{vn_windall}><$ChangeMoney,5000></?></p></br> 


